     iittwwdd — device driver for ITE Super I/O chips watchdog timer

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To compile this driver into the kernel, place the following lines in your
     kernel configuration file:

           ddeevviiccee ssuuppeerriioo
           ddeevviiccee iittwwdd

     Alternatively, to load the driver as a module at boot time, place the
     following line in loader.conf(5):

           itwd_load="YES"

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The iittwwdd driver provides watchdog(4) support for the watchdog timer
     present on at least the following Super I/O chips:
     ••   IT8721F
     ••   IT8728F
     ••   IT8771F

